{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100293","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100293/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100293/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100293/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100293","id":2734179728,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6E7Ncf","number":100293,"title":"Add `Span` struct (replacing `StrRange`). Spans represent read-only access to a contiguous array, resembling `std::span`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":20,"created_at":"2024-12-11T22:42:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T15:16:05Z","closed_at":"2025-03-10T15:07:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100293","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100293.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100293.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-10T15:07:22Z"},"body":"It is currently difficult to run algorithms on `String`, `Vector`, `LocalVector`  data ranges or plain C arrays without copying the data first. This leads to inefficiencies.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the `Span` class. A span represents a view into an array (it's a `pointer` and `size`). \r\nWith `Span`, it will be easier to implement functions with more agnosticism as to the memory storage, helping to reduce unnecessary copies. Additionally, `Span` will help bridge the gap between `LocalVector` and `Vector`, helping to address https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5144.\r\n\r\n`Span` is similar to `StrView` which it replaces, but meant for more than just strings. It is furthermore similar to `VectorView` which will be replaced in a future PR.\r\n\r\n## Example\r\nThe `String.path_to` implementation currently has the following lines of code:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c2e4ae782a399adf42c664d3d21d8defe49ba8e5/core/string/ustring.cpp#L5108-L5109\r\n\r\nHere, the String is first subselected through `substr`, causing a copy to be made.\r\nThen, it is split through a `split` call, through which multiple copies of regions of the string are made.\r\nNone of the regions are modified in the process - the copies are made merely because it is not possible to avoid them.\r\n\r\nAn optimized implementation could look like this:\r\n```c++\r\nLocalVector<Span<char32_t>> src_dirs = spans::split(src.span().subspan(1, src.length() - 2), U'/'); \r\nLocalVector<Span<char32_t>> dst_dirs = spans::split(dst.span().subspan(1, dst.length() - 2), U'/'); \r\n```\r\n\r\nIn this implementation, no copies of the string need to be made, because all `Span`s used here are views into the original string (`spans::split` and `subspan` would need to be added as functions).\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\n`Span` is named after `std::span` of C++20 [std::span](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/span).\r\n`Span` is const-only because a need for mutable spans is not obvious yet. It is easier to use if it is const by default. If mutable spans are needed in the future, it can be proposed then.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100293/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":8,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100293/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}